Bugfix: Add accessible names to the group selection fields in the sharing settings

The group selection fields in the admin sharing settings had no accessible
name. Screen readers announced an unlabeled text box and voice control could
not address the elements at all.

The fields are turned into select2 multi-select widgets at runtime. select2
copies the text of label[for=<id of the original input>] into the offscreen
label of the search field it creates. Without a matching label element that
lookup returns nothing and the widget stays unnamed.

Adding the label restores the mechanism the library already provides. The
rendered layout is unchanged.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 3.3.2, SC 4.1.2, SC 1.3.1
